*.o

# Nix / devenv
.direnv/
.devenv/
.devenv.flake.nix
# Standalone-devenv-CLI artifacts: this repo uses devenv only as a
# flake module (flake.nix + flake.lock).  A stray `devenv` run outside
# the dir shell regenerates these; they must never be committed.
devenv.lock
devenv.yaml
.pre-commit-config.yaml
result
result-*

